draft: DRAFT-libgit2-1.9.0-cmakedeps-uppercase-found
status: pending-editor-review
id: DRAFT-libgit2-cmakedeps-found
doc_file: DRAFT-libgit2-1.9.0-cmakedeps-uppercase-found.md
title: CMakeDeps PREFER_CONFIG=ON 使上游检查大写 *_FOUND 变量的 HTTPS 后端自检测失败（libgit2 SelectHTTPSBackend OPENSSL_FOUND）——变量注入回退模块模式
category: build-system, cmake, conan, cross-compile, openssl
match_keywords: >
  CMAKE_FIND_PACKAGE_PREFER_CONFIG, CMakeDeps, CMakeToolchain, OPENSSL_FOUND,
  openssl_FOUND, SelectHTTPSBackend, Asked for OpenSSL TLS backend, OPENSSL_ROOT_DIR,
  OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR, find_package(OpenSSL), libgit2, USE_HTTPS
error_signature: >
  Asked for OpenSSL TLS backend, but it wasn't found|
  Configuring incomplete, errors occurred.*SelectHTTPSBackend|
  find_package\(OpenSSL\).*OPENSSL_FOUND
root_cause: >
  Conan 2 CMakeToolchain 默认 set(CMAKE_FIND_PACKAGE_PREFER_CONFIG ON)。上游库用
  find_package(OpenSSL) 后检查大写 OPENSSL_FOUND（如 libgit2 cmake/SelectHTTPSBackend
  .cmake:57），但 CMakeDeps 生成的 openssl-config.cmake 只置小写 openssl_FOUND，
  配置模式命中 conan config 后大写 OPENSSL_FOUND 恒为空 → 报"Asked for OpenSSL TLS
  backend, but it wasn't found"。与 DRAFT-13532（target 名失配）同根因
  （PREFER_CONFIG=ON 抢占上游检测），分支不同：本条是 FOUND 变量名大小写失配。
solution: |
  # conanfile.py generate()：关闭 PREFER_CONFIG 并注入 OpenSSL 路径，
  # 使 find_package(OpenSSL) 走 CMake 内置 FindOpenSSL 模块（模块模式置大写
  # OPENSSL_FOUND/OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR/OPENSSL_LIBRARIES）
  def generate(self):
      tc = CMakeToolchain(self)
      tc.variables["CMAKE_FIND_PACKAGE_PREFER_CONFIG"] = "OFF"
      openssl_folder = self.dependencies["openssl"].package_folder
      if openssl_folder:
          tc.variables["OPENSSL_ROOT_DIR"] = openssl_folder
          tc.variables["OPENSSL_INCLUDE_DIR"] = os.path.join(openssl_folder, "include")
      tc.generate()
  # 校验：configure 输出 "-- Found OpenSSL: .../libcrypto.a (found version 1.1.1w)"
  # 与 "* HTTPS, using OpenSSL"；G2 conan create PASS
verify_builds: "libgit2-1.9.0-r01-pc4-30 (conan-verify G2 PASS)"
reference_impl: >
  libgit2 1.9.0（archives/l/libgit2/1.9.0/conanfile.py generate()）；
  同根因族 DRAFT-13532（target 名失配分支，CMAKE_PROJECT_INCLUDE 方案）与
  E473（target 缺失分支，cmake_build_modules 注入）——本分支为 FOUND 变量
  大小写失配，变量注入最轻量
last_updated: 2026-09-18